00:11:43.360 --> 00:11:45.380
So the bulk of the
talk is just running

00:11:45.380 --> 00:11:48.290
through this henceforth.

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:49.550
Okey-doke.

00:11:49.550 --> 00:11:51.940
Now, let's switch to the demo.

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:52.790
Okey-doke.

00:11:52.790 --> 00:11:56.160
So here is the BigQuery UI.

