We'll go with this.

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:22.570
So anyway, this is where the--

00:12:22.570 --> 00:12:24.550
this is where you
compose the queries.

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:27.280
I've run all of
these in advance,

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:29.290
so the results are already here.

00:12:29.290 --> 00:12:32.740
But what I want to show with
