00:13:41.290 --> 00:13:41.790
All right.

00:13:41.790 --> 00:13:45.480
So event type, like, here are
the basic parameters here.

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:47.210
Here's round completed.

00:13:47.210 --> 00:13:49.980
But then still we've
got all the events,

00:13:49.980 --> 00:13:51.950
like the possible event keys.

00:13:51.950 --> 00:13:54.270
And you can see that,
right, this round completed.

00:13:54.270 --> 00:13:57.014
There is data here
for bingos claimed.

00:13:57.014 --> 00:13:57.930
And then further out--

00:13:57.930 --> 00:13:59.790
I won't bother
